        this.Text("MilitechHope-Mastery", "MASTERY — the more you use Hope, the better your nervous system adapts: every 20 activations raise the mastery level (up to V). Each level lowers the capacity cost by 3 (50 → 47 → 44 … → 35) and gives +2% damage, +3% crit damage, +0.3 s of slowdown; the core heats 3% less and cools 6% faster.");
        this.Text("MilitechHope-Burnout", "FLAW: BURNOUT — 10 or more activations within 5 minutes overload the neural circuit: every further activation has a 15% chance to burn the core out. First a storm of system errors, then a discharge: time stops completely, but you are disarmed and can only walk while Hope cools down for 20 s.");
